 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »eQuick 200M« </h3> <h1> Measuring crankshaft milling cutters and turning/turning tools in transmitted light </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>With the ZOLLER »eQuick 200M«, the cutting edges of crankshaft cutters can be ergonomically adjusted and precisely measured in transmitted light.</strong></p> <p>The measurement is non-contact and includes the Z and X dimensions, axial and radial run-out, cutter width and corner radii. The ZOLLER image processing »pilot 2 mT« also offers a cutting edge inspection for quick visual inspection of individual cutting edges.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
